  "body": "Storia 1.0.0 for Minecraft 26.2 (Java 25).\n\n| File | What it is |\n| --- | --- |\n| `storia-1.0.0.jar` | The Storia server (Folia fork). Run `java -jar storia-1.0.0.jar nogui`. |\n| `storia-worker-1.0.0.zip` | Storia Worker: generates terrain for your server on another machine. See README.md inside. |\n| `storia-relay-1.0.0.zip` | Storia Relay: hands terrain work to any number of workers (Java 21+, no Minecraft files). |\n| `storia-proxy-1.0.0.jar` | Storia Proxy: Velocity fork with 50 built-in placeholders ([docs](https://github.com/AKSHRK-Dev/StoriaProxy)). |\n\nAll offload traffic is encrypted and authenticated with your shared secret.\n"
